25
00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:23.950
After you pick the optimizer,
you need to tell the optimizer,

26
00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:26.519
and then you find a version
metric function

27
00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:29.522
and also the training
