28
00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:33.126
The core idea of the requirement is
the optimizer

29
00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:36.629
has to know what is a good program
and what is a bad program.

30
00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:39.466
Different from normal machine
learning job,

